# REST-client examples. Replace placeholders with isolated demo records.
# API authentication is a session cookie for people and X-API-Key for platforms.
@base = http://localhost:8000/api/v1
@worker = 00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001
@job = 00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000002
@platform = 00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000003
@grant = 00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000004
@workerSession = EXISTING_WORKER_SESSION
@customerSession = EXISTING_CUSTOMER_SESSION
@key = DEDICATED_PLATFORM_KEY
@token = SIGNED_CREDENTIAL_TOKEN
@share = RANDOM_SHARE_TOKEN_RETURNED_ONCE
@operation = 00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000005
@consent = RANDOM_PLATFORM_CONSENT_RETURNED_ONCE

### Worker record: 200, real assessment, provenance and separate self-declared count
GET {{base}}/me/record
Cookie: guarantor_session={{workerSession}}

### Credential export: 200, JSON with credential_token and fresh trust_summary
GET {{base}}/workers/{{worker}}/credentials/export
Cookie: guarantor_session={{workerSession}}

### Credential import: 200; repeat the same token => imported_outcomes: 0
POST {{base}}/workers/{{worker}}/credentials/import
Cookie: guarantor_session={{workerSession}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"credential_token":"{{token}}","source_platform":"Source A"}

### Tampered token: 422 REQUEST_FAILED, invalid signature/malformed token detail
POST {{base}}/workers/{{worker}}/credentials/import
Cookie: guarantor_session={{workerSession}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"credential_token":"{{token}}tampered","source_platform":"Source A"}

### Expired token: use an otherwise valid bundle issued more than seven days ago
# Expected: 422 REQUEST_FAILED, "Credential token has expired".
# Wrong-worker token also returns 422; never change the subject to bypass ownership.
POST {{base}}/workers/{{worker}}/credentials/import
Cookie: guarantor_session={{workerSession}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"credential_token":"VALID_BUT_EXPIRED_TOKEN","source_platform":"Source A"}

### Generate public link: 201, token disclosed once, expiry seven days
POST {{base}}/me/worker/shares
Idempotency-Key: {{operation}}
Cookie: guarantor_session={{workerSession}}

### Read public summary: 200, identity/work checks distinct; no detailed history
GET {{base}}/verification/{{share}}

### Revoke owned public link: 204; next GET /verification/{{share}} => 410 LINK_UNAVAILABLE
DELETE {{base}}/me/worker/shares/{{grant}}
Cookie: guarantor_session={{workerSession}}

### Unknown token: 404 LINK_NOT_FOUND
GET {{base}}/verification/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA

### Named platform approval: 201, organization name, permissions and one-time token
POST {{base}}/me/worker/platform-grants
Cookie: guarantor_session={{workerSession}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"organization_id":"{{platform}}","permissions":["read_history","import_history"]}

### Link platform account: 201, canonical worker_id, no name/phone matching
POST {{base}}/platform/worker-links
X-API-Key: {{key}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"external_worker_id":"worker-123","consent_token":"{{consent}}"}

### Unauthorized platform: 401 AUTH_REQUIRED
POST {{base}}/platform/worker-links
X-API-Key: invalid-key
Content-Type: application/json

{"external_worker_id":"worker-123","consent_token":"{{consent}}"}

### Historical import: 200, imported_outcomes: 1, verified_outcomes: 0
# Identical retry with this key returns the original receipt.
# Same facts with a different key return duplicate_outcomes: 1.
POST {{base}}/platform/workers/worker-123/history/import
X-API-Key: {{key}}
Idempotency-Key: external-history-example-1
Content-Type: application/json

{"outcomes":[{"source_record_id":"past-job-1","occurred_at":"2026-10-01T12:00:00+01:00","status":"completed","rating":4,"dispute_resolution":null,"attest":false}]}

### Changed facts reusing idempotency key: 409 IDEMPOTENCY_CONFLICT
POST {{base}}/platform/workers/worker-123/history/import
X-API-Key: {{key}}
Idempotency-Key: external-history-example-1
Content-Type: application/json

{"outcomes":[{"source_record_id":"past-job-1","occurred_at":"2026-10-01T12:00:00+01:00","status":"no_show","attest":false}]}

### An unreviewed key cannot attest: 403 ATTESTATION_NOT_ALLOWED
# With reviewed attestation authority, this instead imports verified own-source evidence.
POST {{base}}/platform/workers/worker-123/history/import
X-API-Key: {{key}}
Idempotency-Key: unauthorized-attestation-example
Content-Type: application/json

{"outcomes":[{"source_record_id":"past-job-2","occurred_at":"2026-10-01T12:00:00+01:00","status":"completed","attest":true}]}

### Approved history: 200 items/total/page/size/pages, provenance, no client identities
GET {{base}}/platform/workers/worker-123/history?page=1&size=20
X-API-Key: {{key}}

### Approved trust query: 200 decision/confidence/band from eligible persisted evidence
POST {{base}}/trust/query
X-API-Key: {{key}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"worker_id":"{{worker}}","platform_type":"generic","job_context":{"job_type":"cleaning","value_band":"low"}}

### Revoke platform grant: 204; subsequent history read => 403 CONSENT_EXPIRED
# Subsequent trust/query => 403 CONSENT_REQUIRED. Downloaded data cannot be recalled.
DELETE {{base}}/me/worker/platform-grants/{{grant}}
Cookie: guarantor_session={{workerSession}}

### Review eligibility: 200 eligible/reasons/existing_review for attributed hiring customer
GET {{base}}/jobs/{{job}}/review-eligibility
Cookie: guarantor_session={{customerSession}}

### Eligible protected review: 201 id/job_id/rating/submitted_at; comment stays private
# Use a completed protected independent job with explicit dual confirmation.
# Matching retry returns same receipt. New key/payload for same job => 409 REVIEW_EXISTS.
POST {{base}}/jobs/{{job}}/review
Cookie: guarantor_session={{customerSession}}
Idempotency-Key: customer-review-example-1
Content-Type: application/json

{"rating":4,"comment":"Completed the agreed work."}

### Ineligible attributed job: 403 REVIEW_INELIGIBLE with eligibility reasons
# Replace job with one lacking protection/identity/confirmation or having an open dispute.
# An unrelated customer's job returns 404 JOB_NOT_FOUND instead.
POST {{base}}/jobs/{{job}}/review
Cookie: guarantor_session={{customerSession}}
Idempotency-Key: ineligible-review-example
Content-Type: application/json

{"rating":5}

### Invalid review rating: 422 INVALID_INPUT (integer rating required)
POST {{base}}/jobs/{{job}}/review
Cookie: guarantor_session={{customerSession}}
Idempotency-Key: invalid-rating-example
Content-Type: application/json

{"rating":4.5}

# Retryable failure examples:
# Sixth review attempt within the same UTC minute => 429 REVIEW_RATE_LIMIT.
# Eleventh successful review in rolling 24h => 429 REVIEW_VELOCITY_LIMIT.
# Stop isolated demo Redis, then submit => 503 LIMITER_UNAVAILABLE, Retry-After: 60.
# Preserve the same draft/idempotency key. Check review-eligibility for a receipt
# after an interrupted response before resubmission. Do not retry invalid input
# or re-enable a revoked grant without a new worker approval.


### Canonical complete history: 200, all statuses and honest provenance, 20 per page
GET {{base}}/me/record/history?page=1&size=20
Cookie: guarantor_session={{workerSession}}

### Compatibility record: 200; same assessment/evidence, original projection
GET {{base}}/me/worker/record?page=1&size=20
Cookie: guarantor_session={{workerSession}}

### Customer entry: 200, jobs with client_id matching this session only
GET {{base}}/me/client/jobs?page=1&size=20
Cookie: guarantor_session={{customerSession}}

### Lost share response: 200 receipt, token:null; 404 if not completed
GET {{base}}/me/worker/shares/operations/{{operation}}
Cookie: guarantor_session={{workerSession}}

### Identical share retry: 201, same id, token:null after original committed
POST {{base}}/me/worker/shares
Idempotency-Key: {{operation}}
Cookie: guarantor_session={{workerSession}}

### Idempotent named-platform approval; use a fresh UUID for a new operation
POST {{base}}/me/worker/platform-grants
Idempotency-Key: {{operation}}
Cookie: guarantor_session={{workerSession}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"organization_id":"{{platform}}","permissions":["read_history"]}

### Reconcile approval: 200 receipt with token:null
GET {{base}}/me/worker/platform-grants/operations/{{operation}}
Cookie: guarantor_session={{workerSession}}

### Changed approval details reuse operation: 409 IDEMPOTENCY_CONFLICT
POST {{base}}/me/worker/platform-grants
Idempotency-Key: {{operation}}
Cookie: guarantor_session={{workerSession}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"organization_id":"{{platform}}","permissions":["import_history"]}

### Revocation before replacement: 204, then create with a fresh operation UUID
DELETE {{base}}/me/worker/platform-grants/{{grant}}
Cookie: guarantor_session={{workerSession}}
